# ── Source archive ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The originals are ~600 MB. The site serves only assets/, so these stay out
# of the repository. Keep them backed up somewhere else — they are not in git.
#
# Leading slashes matter: they anchor each pattern to the repository root.
# Without them, "Blog/" would also match "assets/img/blog/" — and on Windows,
# where git ignores case by default, it silently did.
/Selected Works/
/Blog/
/CV/
/Publications/
/my photo.jpg

# ── Not part of the site ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
/skills/

# ── Editor and OS noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.~lock.*#
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.bak
